{"title":"Wool for Winter","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Wanted: ten bundles of wool, to knit for the pickers before the cold comes. The sheep northeast of the orchard have plenty to spare. You&#39;ll need shears. Bring the wool to the orchard. (Jill Appleseed)</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><span class=\"muted\">unknown</span></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a> <b>×10</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to the quest-giver to get the quest.</li><li value=\"2\">Bring 10 wool to Jill Appleseed in Havenheim <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 452, 145</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"452|145|Bring 10 wool to Jill Appleseed in Havenheim\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><p class=\"muted\">No rewards recorded.</p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Wool for Winter</